      "title": "btle: Fix parsing of empty extendend advertising header",
      "message": "btle: Fix parsing of empty extendend advertising header\n\nFix parsing of extended advertising when the extended advertising header\nis empty. The flag field is excluded when none of the fields are present\nand the extended header length field is 0.\n\nSigned-off-by: Joakim Andersson <joakim.andersson@nordicsemi.no>\n",
      "author_name": "Joakim Andersson",
      "author_email": "joakim.andersson@nordicsemi.no",
      "authored_date": "2021-06-25T11:40:28.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
